# ( - ) after title = not a dance tune 
# Same tune, different versions = title (source name) 
# Same name, different tune = title 1, title 2, etc. 
# Title * = name assigned by BB to a "gan ainm" tune
# Text after % or %% is non-printing
# "Coda" ends a circular tune or returns a tune to the tonic note; use is optional
# Source abbreviations: www.capeirish.com/ittl/folder-keys/ (link at bottom of
the HTML page)
# To add numbers to the first measures of a staff: insert "%%barnumbers 0" (without quotes) anywhere in the file header

