N:N: One of the best-liked "newly-composed tunes" (well, relatively) in the ITM
N:repertoire. Composed by Davey Arthur (best known for his banjo work with 
N:the Furey Brothers), this tune is played in either A minor or D minor, which-
N:ever key suits the instrument. This setting is from Brian Conway. (Note: you 
N:can substitute /a/ for the /c'/ in measure 10 of the Am version.)
